# New game as Chris: title -> NEW GAME -> character select -> prologue movie
# -> main hall cutscene -> door animation -> the dining room, where the
# player first gets control. Then walk back, turn and run.
#
# This path found two 64-bit bugs (an unsigned negative step in Joint_move's
# reverse animation, and a truncated owner pointer in the door animation).

700   press ACTION          # PRESS ANY BUTTON
760   press ACTION          # NEW GAME
860   press ACTION          # Chris
960   press ACTION          # confirm

9600  capture main_hall.png
9600  expect room == 6

10200 capture dining_room.png
10200 expect room == 5
10200 expect health == 140
10200 expect x == 30900
10200 expect z == 8300

10200 hold DOWN 60          # step back
10300 hold LEFT 20          # turn
10320 hold UP+RUN 45        # run
10400 capture dining_room_moved.png
10400 dump dining_room_moved.json
10400 expect room == 5
10400 expect x == 31547
10400 expect z == 6440
10400 expect angle == 128
10400 expect health == 140
10401 quit
